{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X的叙事压缩得比较狠，部分心理转折只交代了结果，没有充分说明触发原因，人物为什么这样想、为什么改变，Y交代得更清楚。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X的重点有加亮，话句短，层次清楚，感受又能随着音乐节点出现，普通观众更容易一边听一边抓住每段的核心。它的感受描写也更细腻，能把音色、动作、身体感觉和复杂情绪联系起来。Y的优势是人物动机和前后因果交代得更完整，但长句与密集短词同时出现，容易让观众忙于阅读，反而削弱了听音乐时的扫读体验。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "2eb7e512-c02e-40e6-ae58-c32988f5bf9b", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T052255069768Z", "elapsed_seconds": 81.062, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T05:24:16.140486+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "be95090084a63a674b764f8fa989775ceeb2bd4b1a19fa3293cb012e751a7155", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa238